AsStream(remaining);\n        }\n        return answer;\n    }\n\n    protected BrokerService createBrokerService(URI brokerURI, Map<Object, Object> properties) {\n        return new BrokerService();\n    }\n}\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791130109332}}
